	// the slice taking all four
	// example wanted: times 0 over a non-empty list of results; the slice from 0 to 0 decides it
	// example wanted: a negative times over a non-empty list of results; the slice clamps rather
	// than counting from the end
	// example wanted: times exactly equal to the number of results; the exact threshold of the
